    "title": "Macy's 4th of July Fireworks in NYC | Brooklyn Bridge Park 🇺🇸🎇",
    "text": "Macy's 4th of July Fireworks in NYC | Brooklyn Bridge Park 🇺🇸🎇In this video, we take a trip to New York City with our daughter Jessica and her fiancé, Kaleb. We do some sightseeing, but the main highlight of the trip was the Macy's 4th of July Celebration at Brooklyn Bridge Park (purchase tickets through the Mayor's office). All I have to say is - WOW! I have never seen anything like it. The fireworks were absolutely magnificent! The only downside was getting back to our hotel in Manhattan after the show, but it was worth it. This is truly something everyone should experience at least once. ❤️ NYC! If you enjoyed this video, we'd love for you to like, subscribe, and join us for more travel memories and adventures.",
